# BUZZBOLT: wave 1's boss, the Ironback pair, can be beaten. Both must
# fall; each drops three letters; then the next wave starts. (The demo
# player flies the lacewing with real presses.)
game buzzbolt
press A
wait 10
press A
wait 10
cheat lives 3
cheat boss
waituntil boss_count == 2 200
expect boss_kind == 1
botuntil boss_dead == 1 6000
expect boss_count == 0
expect drops == 6
waituntil state == 4 400
expect wave == 1
waituntil state == 3 400
expect wave == 2
